                  Parameters for HISTSMTH
                  ***********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
data.dat                     \file with data
3   0                        \   columns for variable and weight
-1.0e21  1.0e21              \   trimming limits
Primary Variable             \title
histsmth.ps                  \file for PostScript output
 30                          \   number of hist classes (for display)
histsmth_run.out             \file for smoothed output
100    0.01  20.0            \smoothing limits: number, min, max
0                            \0=arithmetic, 1=log scaling
750    50   0.0001   69069   \maxpert, reporting interval,min Obj,Seed
1  1  1  1                   \1=on,0=off: mean,var,smth,quantiles
1. 1. 2. 2.                  \weighting : mean,var,smth,quantiles
  5                          \size of smoothing window
-999.0 -999.0                \target mean and variance (-999=>data)
5                            \number of quantiles: defined from data
0                            \number of quantiles: defined by user
0.5    1.66                  \   cdf, z
